Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:11.88,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,Do you mean Gatlantis are like humans,\N Chief Navigator Ichinose ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:14.91,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,It's based on how the battle opened at Saturn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:18.67,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,They're man made soldiers, who\N aren't afraid of blowing{detonating} themselves up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:23.63,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,The White Comet is a means of \Ndestruction from ancient Archelias.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:25.28,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,They use…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.52,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,But they're taking the shape of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:34.95,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,Man made lifeforms should be able to \Nmechanize themselves for more efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:45.94,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All Inferno Canone ships are fully charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:49.38,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Wipe them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:12.45,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Damn them !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.45,0:03:14.99,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,High energy signatures detected below the ring !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:42.00,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:45.75,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Their planet was near dead\N after their war with Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:48.26,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}How do they possess \Nsuch massive military power ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:50.39,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing yourself, Balsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:55.63,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,You must not turn around and withdraw \Nthe fleet entrusted to you by His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:58.37,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,You are a Gatlantian. Die in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:04:59.23,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:12.84,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,This is amazing. \NWhere did you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:17.59,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Are you sure ? \NIt can cure the meteorite bomb syndrome ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:22.90,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,It should, although it was only\N tested on some artificial cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:29.88,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,So, it's curable…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:32.53,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Curable…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:40.47,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Can you use this sample to mass produce it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:42.28,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,That's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:46.01,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,When it comes to producing\N this drug, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:51.28,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Besides that, how did you get this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:53.54,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Hey !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:09.46,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Now, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:14.14,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,The drug can cure your child…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:20.14,def2,KATSURAGI…and,0,0,0,,...and many others who suffer from the same illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:25.98,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,The recipe is simple, \Nso it can be made on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:27.20,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:31.88,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Who is it ?!\N Who's helping you ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:32.76,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Tell me !{Say it !}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:36.63,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:39.33,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,If I die, so does your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.38,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Why ?\NWhy're you doing this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:55.78,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,With the power you guys have, you should be \Nable to destroy the Yamato and Earth so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:56.98,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,So, why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:06:59.00,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,It's a game…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:04.63,def2,KATSURAGI…game,0,0,0,,...a game of people tormented by love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:07.06,def2,KATSURAGI…game,0,0,0,,So, I'll keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:11.80,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{sou}Otherwise, the game would be boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:22.98,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:28.54,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,I've discovered the\N gimmick that planet is using.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:32.36,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Time fault…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:36.46,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:43.43,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Gatlantis Empire, execute a phase transition jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:54.18,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Move aside{Make way}, Balsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:54.88,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. {Can be omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:25.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The White Comet has appeared.\N It's estimated heading is Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:29.33,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,All ships, maintain gunnery formation, and pull back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:32.41,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Proceed to Plan M.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:47.77,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Tsubasa…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:24.28,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,According to the report from the Yamato, the core of the White Comet is estimated to be a planet-sized, man made fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:28.18,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,All fleets, take multi-tier formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:33.70,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Barrage and destroy the Gatlantis \Nstronghold hidden inside the comet !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:09:58.73,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Aren't you rushing this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:02.30,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The identity of the Comet\N hasn't been discovered yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:06.66,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Ambassador Barrel, this is Earth's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.49,0:10:12.38,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,To prepare for the future negotiation, \Nwe'll take another shot at the Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:14.68,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:19.23,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}...your idea, Mr. President ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.71,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:33.74,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Deploy the graviton spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:39.68,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.00,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,All ships, prepare to fire wave motion guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.86,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Comet is gaining speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:01.87,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Gravitational field conversion factor\N has reached the planned value.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:06.62,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Target the core of the comet. Set 20-45.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.19,0:11:12.09,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Set 20-45. Synchronize the dispersion\N wave motion guns to converge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:14.80,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Energy charge, 120%.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:17.81,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Prepare for shock and flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.14,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Ten seconds to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:24.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:25.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:26.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:27.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...six...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:28.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...five...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:29.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...four...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:30.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...three...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:31.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:32.33,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...one…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:34.08,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:34.12,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Did we do it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:36.55,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Crush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:55.38,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,All ships, charge wave motion guns !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:13.06,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Wave motion guns, fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.46,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Gravitational downdraft strengthening !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:07.72,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Unable to slow down !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.72,0:16:09.72,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Turn around !\N All ships, break away !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:46.60,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Wave motion gun barrels are heavily damaged !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:47.85,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,We're being pulled in !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:50.73,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Engine output decreasing !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:54.26,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Contact with the Apollo Norm !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:54.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:06.76,def2,YASUDA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Commander Yamanami, please go.\NThe Apollo Norm is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:08.82,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Captain Yasuda…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:11.48,def2,YASUDA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}We'll push the Andromeda \Nwith our remaining energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.34,0:17:16.34,def2,YASUDA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Yamanami, you did your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:18.26,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Yasuda…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:20.39,def2,YASUDA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:25.96,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:28.52,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's Gatlantis ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:30.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,How're we supposed to fight that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:33.70,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Kodai…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:38.10,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,…we'll bet on the transit wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:41.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:52.77,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Teresa said the power of fate that acts \Nbetween people will defeat the Comet Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:56.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Let's trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:19:01.41,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Fate brought us to this ship, and we're\N going to engage in a decisive battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:07.96,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,What gives power to fate \Nmust be the will of each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:15.62,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,The people of Earth are not \Nwilling to yield to their invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:20.78,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,We crawled out of the danger \Nof extinction three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:34.86,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,Mankind will not back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:38.12,def2,PRESIDENT,0,0,0,,We unite and fight until the end…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:43.57,def2,PRESIDENT…in,0,0,0,,...in order to preserve freedom and peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:48.01,def2,PRESIDENT…for,0,0,0,,...for the future of our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.45,0:20:01.51,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Only parental love can save a child from dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:03.98,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Isn't that right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.40,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,It's incomparable love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:12.75,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Selfish love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:17.38,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Love that destroys everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:21.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What the hell have you done ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:29.49,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Tsubasa…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:39.92,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,When Tsubasa was born, \NI felt like I learned why I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:45.14,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,There are so many hardships in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:49.91,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,But still, he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:55.40,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't matter why...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:21:02.36,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,…because I'm so glad to be\N able to meet Sabu, and Tsubasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:07.93,def2,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,I don't need any reason for being happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:22.04,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:27.80,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,…your dad will…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:31.99,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,…go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.14,0:21:40.88,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,What ?!\NChief, the output…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:51.70,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,The wave motion engine has gone silent !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:54.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Oh, no. The anti-wave motion \Nphoton's have gone out of control ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:07.57,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,We're entering the gravitational\N field of the Comet Empire !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:44.78,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 18
