Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:55.78,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Sotto oyasuminasai
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:55.78,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}A gentle goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:03.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Osanago no youna toiki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:03.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}You breathe like a little child
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:12.88,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsumademo soba ni iru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:12.88,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll be by your side forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:18.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Mabuta tojite
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:18.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}So close your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:31.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hidamari no takeru youna yasashisa de...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:31.80,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}As gentle as warm sunlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:38.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Tsusumi komu yo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:38.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}...I'll embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:45.40,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Shiawase umidasu chikara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:45.40,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}The power to bring happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:59.27,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Fuwari fuwari fuwa fuwa yume no naka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:59.27,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Drifting and floating, feeling like I'm having a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:11.96,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Omoi haseru yorisoinagara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:11.96,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Cuddling up and thinking of you from afar
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:26.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itsudemo waratte ite hoshii to negau
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:26.79,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My wish is for you to keep on smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:39.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ubu na egao tayasanu youni
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.78,0:24:39.87,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}Never let your childlike smile disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:52.25,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Itooshii hito yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:52.25,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i0\c&HFFFFFF&}My dearest{loved} one...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.98,0:25:21.38,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.89,0:25:27.78,def2,I,0,0,0,,I won't let you get through...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.18,0:25:29.98,def2,I,0,0,0,,...Gatlantis !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.83,0:25:33.98,def2,I,0,0,0,,{\pos(946,582)\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga
